  "description": "Learn to glide with the Flyer Glider Jr. with Light Up Wheels! This high-performance, 3-wheel beginner scooter grows with your\ntoddler as they learn to ride. The premium polyurethane wheels feature LED lights and high-performance bearings, which offer a\nfast ride and propel your child further with fewer kicks. The nylon clamp adjusts the handlebar to any height, ensuring years of\nfun. Lean-to-steer technology improves balance and makes carving and turning fun! The durable nylon-composite deck is\nflexible and absorbs shock which provides a smooth, safe ride on any sidewalk. This scooter also features a quick stopping foot\nbrake for added control. The Flyer Glider Jr. with Light Up Wheels is available in red, blue, and pink. Recommended for ages 2-5\nyears. Maximum weight capacity 44 lbs",
